#doc (Manual) "Irreducible (simple) representation" =>
# Irreducible (simple) representation
%%%
tag := "Chapter2/Definition2.3.5"
number := false
%%%
*Definition 2.3.5.* A representation $`V \neq 0` of $`A` is *irreducible* (or *simple*) if the only subrepresentations of $`V` are $`0` and $`V`.
